# Left out of git archive, so out of GitHub's tag archives (a packaged app's remote install and server update download
# one), a checkout's remote install and server update, and a synced copy's (remote-install.mjs sourceArchive). The app
# needs none of them to install, build or run. docs/brand stays: the packaged app's icon (package.json build.icon) is there.
/test export-ignore
/docs/guide.md export-ignore
/.cursor export-ignore
/.github export-ignore
/.githooks export-ignore
/contracts.md export-ignore
/CONTRIBUTING.md export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
